Third-party code: the directories cf-bench/fixtures/*/node_modules/ contain
vendored third-party npm packages (express, rxjs and their transitive
dependencies), committed deliberately so that benchmark runs require no network
access or `npm install`. Those packages are distributed under their own terms
(MIT, Apache-2.0, 0BSD and BSD variants) and each retains its own LICENSE file.
The MIT grant above applies only to the code authored in this repository.
